# The xorg_server port compiles libmd (SHA1) in-place from sha1.c during its
# build (see ../../port.def.sh: `cd "$FILES/libmd" && $TCGCC -c sha1.c ...`).
# The resulting object + archive are build products, not sources — ignore them
# so a completed xorg build does not leave the ports repo permanently "dirty"
# (which forces downstream clean rebuilds and can strand other ports' staging).
sha1.o
libmd.a
